  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacities of employers&apos; and workers&apos; organizations to participate effectively in the development of social and labour policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will build on the strategy, structures and systems that were developed so far, to further enhance workers&#x2019; voice and promote social dialogue. The programme will support the roll-out of legislation that makes joint committees mandatory for companies of a certain size. This will include an analysis of the joint committee programme to date and consultations with Qatar Chamber of Commerce and Industry (QCCI) and worker representatives. ILO will support MoL to enhance the online portal for joint committees as well as on new institutional agreements with service providers who can deliver training programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
